<title>CHINA: CMB announces 2nd interim dividend.</title>
<headline>CMB announces 2nd interim dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)	10.0 vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Company name		   China Motor Bus Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		    August 5-6</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	     August 11</p>
<p>Note - China Motor Bus operates franchised public buses in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The company proposed a special dividend of 140 H.K. cents per share vs 55 cents.</p>
<p>The group pays two interim and one final dividend a year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
